{"item_id": "BM0364", "position": 364, "batch": "2026-11-25_kc-c2_17", "anon_id": "M-17-003", "kind": "solve-compute", "role": "C2", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "status": "computed", "r_code": "pt <- prop.test(c(20, 10), c(50, 50), correct = FALSE)\nvalue <- pt$p.value\nest <- pt$estimate\nanswer <- if (value < 0.05 && est[1] > est[2]) \"D\" else if (value >= 0.05) \"A\" else \"B\"", "answer_expression": "", "test_inputs": [], "correct_options": ["D"], "note": "Reruns prop.test: p is about 0.029, below 0.05, and prop 1 is larger than prop 2."}
