{"item_id": "BM1322", "position": 366, "batch": "2026-11-25_kc-c2_17", "anon_id": "M-17-005", "kind": "solve-compute", "role": "C2", "model": "claude-opus-5-5", "status": "computed", "r_code": "n_new <- 400 * (0.25 / 0.125)^2\nvalue <- n_new\nanswer <- if (abs(value - 1600) < 1e-8) \"A\" else if (abs(value - 800) < 1e-8) \"B\" else if (abs(value - 6400) < 1e-8) \"C\" else \"D\"", "answer_expression": "", "test_inputs": [], "correct_options": ["A"], "note": "Margin of error is proportional to 1/sqrt(n), so halving it needs four times the sample size."}
